// merging, spacing, margin, extrude and power-of-two size. Input: files, folders,
// pasted files, every frame of animated GIFs, SVG at a chosen scale. Output: PNG or
// WebP plus TexturePacker JSON Hash / JSON Array, Sparrow/Starling XML or CSS.
// No upload. Only the layout and export options are persisted (policy: preference).
